  "summary": "<p>I reviewed <code>shipping_rate</code> in <code>src/parcel_rates.py</code>, the only public function of parcel-rates. It had no tests. I wrote 9 tests from the rate table in the docstring: one per weight band, both band edges, both surcharge rules and both rejected weights.</p><p>8 tests pass. 1 test fails because a parcel of exactly 5 kg is priced at 1800 instead of 900 (defect D-1). Every mutant in the red check made at least one test fail.</p>",
  "verdict": { "status": "conditional", "text": "The tests are ready to merge. The code is not: fix the 5 kg band edge (D-1) before release." },
